---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'September 3, 2026';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How AI DEV (inteligenciaartificialdev.com) collects, uses, and protects your information.">
  <section class="container legal-page">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy explains how AI DEV (inteligenciaartificialdev.com,
        "we," "us," or "our") collects, uses, and protects information when
        you visit this site or interact with our newsletter, contact form, or
        PromptVault product.
      </p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>
        We collect information you provide directly, such as your name and
        email address when you submit the contact form or subscribe to our
        newsletter. We also collect standard technical data automatically —
        things like your browser type, device, approximate location, and
        pages visited — typically through cookies or similar technologies
        used by our hosting and analytics providers.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use your information</h2>
      <p>
        We use the information we collect to send the newsletter you signed
        up for, respond to messages sent through the contact form, understand
        how visitors use the site so we can improve it, and maintain the
        security of the site.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
      <p>
        We use essential cookies to keep the site working correctly, and may
        use analytics cookies to understand traffic patterns. If we display
        third-party advertising in the future — such as Google AdSense —
        those partners may use cookies to serve ads based on your visits to
        this and other websites. You can opt out of personalized advertising
        through your browser settings or through
        {' '}<a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Ad Settings</a>.
        See our <a href="/cookie-policy">Cookie Policy</a> for details.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party services</h2>
      <p>
        We rely on third-party services to operate this site — an email
        delivery provider for the newsletter and contact form, and a
        separate platform for PromptVault subscriptions. Each of these
        providers processes data under its own privacy policy.
      </p>

      <h2>Data retention</h2>
      <p>
        We keep the information described above only as long as needed for
        the purposes outlined here, or until you ask us to delete it.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask to see, correct, or delete the personal data we hold
        about you, and you can unsubscribe from the newsletter at any time
        using the link in any email we send. To make a request, contact us
        using the details below.
      </p>

      <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
      <p>
        This site is not directed at children under 13, and we do not
        knowingly collect personal information from them.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy from time to time. We'll update the "Last
        updated" date above when we do.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy? Reach out through our
        {' '}<a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding-block: 56px 80px;
    max-width: 68ch;
  }

  .updated {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin: 12px 0 32px;
  }
</style>
